# Local TLS material for the HTTPS dev server
#
# Generated per workstation with `npm run certificates:generate` and never
# committed: a key in version control is the same key in every clone and on every
# machine that has ever had a copy, so it cannot be rotated and cannot be trusted.
#
# The certificate is ignored alongside its key even though a certificate is public,
# because the two are only valid as a pair - shipping one without the other leaves
# the dev server presenting a certificate no local key matches.
#
# The extension patterns are the guard against the next one: they cover the formats
# that carry a private key, so a key added anywhere in this workspace is ignored by
# default rather than by remembering to add it here.
apps/client/localhost.cert
apps/client/localhost.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pem
*.pfx

# System Files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
